In this phase, the requirements needed to develop the project are identified.

Functional Requirements
User should select a shopping/planning category.
User should enter the total budget.
User should select a priority.
System should calculate budget allocation.
System should recommend suitable items.
System should display planned spending.
System should display remaining budget.
User should be able to replace or swap recommended items.
System should display money-saving tips.
Non-Functional Requirements
Simple and user-friendly interface.
Responsive design.
Fast response.
Easy navigation.
Clear display of budget information.
